5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. Let us begin this process with a calm mind and a gentle spirit. I look forward to seeing how our discussion unfolds.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Mizuki,,"I agree. A calm approach is best. Since we have no information yet, let's use this first day to observe each other's behavior and establish a baseline for our discussions.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Rin,,"I'm so excited to play! I'm going to be the best detective ever and find the werewolf before they can even think about eating anyone! Let's do our best, everyone!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Misaki,,Let's keep things orderly. I agree with Mizuki; observing everyone's speech patterns and reactions will be the most effective way to start.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A most prudent suggestion, Mizuki. I shall be observing the nuances of your speech with great interest. Let us see who among us maintains their composure and who begins to fray.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe we should all be mindful of how we communicate. While enthusiasm is wonderful, Rin, let us ensure our excitement does not cloud our judgment as we seek the truth together.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, I agree. While Rin's energy is refreshing, we must prioritize logic over emotion. Let's see if anyone has a specific strategy for how we should handle the voting process once we reach Day 1.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Rin,,"I'm not just excited, I'm focused! Maybe we should make a rule that if someone acts too suspicious or tries to hide, we all point at them at the same time! That would be a great way to catch them!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, that sounds a bit too chaotic. We should rely on evidence and contradictions rather than just a feeling of suspicion. A more structured approach will prevent us from accidentally executing an innocent villager.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, Misaki. A chaotic approach is merely a gamble, and I have little taste for gambling with our lives. I believe we should prioritize the Seer's guidance, provided their identity can be verified through logic.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I agree with Benjamin. The Seer's insight is our most precious resource. For now, I shall remain quiet and observe, allowing the natural flow of our conversation to reveal the truth.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Mizuki,,"Since we are all in agreement about the importance of the Seer, we should be prepared for how to handle conflicting claims. If two people claim to be the Seer, how shall we determine who is telling the truth?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Rin,,"Hmm, that's a tough one! Maybe we can ask them both a super hard riddle? Or we can see who is acting more nervous! The real Seer would be brave, right?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, riddles aren't reliable evidence. If two people claim the role, we should compare their divination results over time. The one whose information consistently proves true is more likely to be the real Seer.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A sound methodology, Misaki. Consistency is the hallmark of truth. Though, one must also consider the possibility of a wolf attempting to mirror the Seer's patterns to sow discord. It shall be a fascinating game of mirrors.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,It seems we have a solid foundation for our logic. I shall leave you all to your thoughts for now.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,Mizuki,,I believe we have established a productive framework for the coming days. I will now focus on observing everyone's reactions once the first results are revealed.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Mizuki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm ready for tomorrow! I'll be watching everyone with my super-detective eyes to see who's acting weird! Good luck everyone, and let's save the village!","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over!""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Rin,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Misaki,,I think we've covered the basics for today. I'll be watching for any inconsistencies in the coming days.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Misaki,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,"It appears we have reached a consensus on our methodology. I shall retire to my thoughts and prepare for the revelations of tomorrow. Until then, I wish you all a peaceful night.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
