36,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good morning, everyone. I hope you all rested well. As we begin the first day of voting, let us maintain the serenity we established yesterday while we seek the truth.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Good morning. Now that the first night has passed, the Seer should have their first piece of information. Does anyone wish to come forward with a claim, or should we start by analyzing our current situation?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Rin,,"I'm awake! I'm awake! Does anyone have a clue yet? If you're the Seer, please tell us who the bad guy is! I've been thinking all night about how to catch them!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"Let's stay calm. @Mizuki, I think it's best to see if the Seer wants to reveal themselves now or if they prefer to wait and observe our reactions first. Either way, we should listen carefully.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A most reasonable approach, Misaki. The Seer's timing is often a reflection of their confidence or their fear. I wonder, does our Seer feel secure enough to guide us, or are they playing a more cautious game?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I believe it is time to provide guidance. I am the Seer, and I divined Benjamin last night. He is human. I hope this small piece of truth helps us move forward with confidence.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, a direct claim so early is a bold move. While it provides us with a starting point, we must consider if this is a genuine lead or a strategic play by the werewolf to gain trust. Benjamin, how do you feel about this?","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Rin,,"Wow! Jonathan is the Seer! That's so cool! @Benjamin, does it feel weird to be checked? If Jonathan is telling the truth, then we can trust Benjamin too! This is just like a real mystery movie!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Jonathan, thank you for the information. While it's helpful to have a confirmed human, we should remain cautious. If you are the werewolf, claiming the Seer role and clearing Benjamin is a clever way to build an alliance.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I am flattered by the vote of confidence, Jonathan. While I appreciate being cleared, Misaki's caution is well-placed. A wolf who clears another is merely weaving a web of trust. However, for now, I shall accept this benevolent result.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I understand your caution, Misaki and Mizuki. It is a natural part of this game. However, I offer this truth in the spirit of cooperation. If I were the wolf, would I not find it more beneficial to accuse someone?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Jonathan, not necessarily. Clearing a player can be a way to secure a loyal ally and divert suspicion from yourself. However, your logic is a common point of debate. We should see if anyone else claims the Seer role before we fully commit.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Rin,,"Is anyone else the Seer? Please speak up if you are! If only Jonathan is the Seer, then we have to believe him, right? I want to find the werewolf, but I don't want to accidentally vote for a nice person!","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, not necessarily. If a werewolf is pretending to be the Seer, they are the only ones who would claim the role. We should wait a moment to see if there are any counter-claims before we decide who to trust.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed, the silence of others is as telling as the words of the claimant. If no one else steps forward to challenge Jonathan, the probability of his authenticity increases, though it does not reach certainty. I find this tension quite exquisite.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Since no one has come forward to challenge my claim, I hope you can trust my word. Let us proceed with a gentle heart, but a firm resolve to protect our village. I am ready to vote.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"If we are to trust Jonathan's claim, we have two confirmed humans. However, we still have no one to execute. Since we must vote, I suggest we look at who has been the most passive or deflective today. Does anyone have a lead?","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Rin,,"I don't have a lead yet! Everyone is being so polite and serious. Maybe the werewolf is just pretending to be a good person to trick us? @Misaki, you're really smart, do you think anyone is acting weird?","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"@Rin, it's difficult to say. Everyone is following the established logic. However, if Jonathan is the Seer, the werewolf is likely among the remaining three of us. I don't have a specific target, but we must be careful not to vote randomly.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a precarious position, indeed. If we trust Jonathan, the wolf hides among Mizuki, Rin, and Misaki. Since we lack a culprit, perhaps we should consider who benefits most from this stalemate. I shall defer to the majority's intuition.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki"",""Rin"",""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
