69,2,1,talk,Mizuki,,"The results are in. Misaki has been executed, and Jonathan was attacked last night. This is a critical development. If Jonathan was the real Seer, the werewolf has just eliminated our most valuable asset.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Misaki"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,2,1,talk,Rin,,"Oh no! Jonathan was attacked! That's so scary! If he was the real Seer, the werewolf is super mean for taking him away! Does this mean the werewolf is one of us? I'm getting nervous now!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,"It is a tragedy, though a predictable one. The werewolf has efficiently pruned the village's sight. If Jonathan was indeed the Seer, we are now blind, wandering in a fog of our own making. How very poetic.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,2,2,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, poetry aside, we must be pragmatic. Jonathan's death strongly suggests he was the Seer, as the werewolf would naturally target the person providing the village with information. This leaves only three of us.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,2,2,talk,Rin,,"Wait, if Jonathan was the Seer, then the werewolf is definitely one of us three! That means the bad guy is right here! @Mizuki, @Benjamin, who do you think it is? I'm going to use my super-detective eyes!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"The ""super-detective eyes"" are a charming tool, Rin, but I fear they may be overwhelmed by the current fog. If we accept that Jonathan was the Seer, the wolf is indeed among us, hiding behind a mask of innocence.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,2,3,talk,Mizuki,,"@Rin, let's stay focused. If Jonathan was the Seer, he cleared Benjamin. That would mean the werewolf is either you or me. However, we must also consider the possibility that Jonathan was the werewolf, and his death was a fake-out to make us trust Benjamin.","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Jonathan"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,2,3,talk,Rin,,"What?! That's so confusing! Why would Jonathan pretend to be the Seer if he was the bad guy? That sounds like a super scary plan! But if he was the real Seer, then it's just me or Mizuki... I'm not the werewolf! I promise!","{""words"":44,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
77,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A fascinating dilemma, is it not? If we follow Mizuki's logic, the circle of suspicion narrows quite elegantly. However, we must not forget the Possessed, who dances in the shadows with the wolf. The truth is rarely a straight line.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
78,2,4,talk,Mizuki,,"@Benjamin, you bring up the Possessed, which complicates things. If Jonathan was the Seer and cleared you, you could still be the Possessed. However, the most likely scenario is that the wolf is among us. Rin, your panic is natural, but we need a decision.","{""words"":45,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Jonathan"",""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,2,4,talk,Rin,,"I'm not panicking! I'm just thinking really hard! If Jonathan was the Seer and he said Benjamin is a good person, then it has to be Mizuki! @Mizuki, why are you trying to make me look suspicious? You're the werewolf, aren't you!","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Benjamin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
80,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,"The accusations are flying with such delightful vigor. Rin, your sudden certainty is quite a leap, though I admire the passion. Mizuki, your logic is sound, yet it leaves us in a precarious deadlock. I wonder, who truly benefits from this chaos?","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Rin"",""Mizuki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
